        <h1 class="hero-title" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/ann-arbor-assault-crimes.astro:xw0big">Ann Arbor Assault Defense Attorney Joe Simon Local, 5-Stars</h1>

        <p class="hero-intro" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/ann-arbor-assault-crimes.astro:kyt8as">Defending Ann Arbor Assault Charges With Excellence For Over 38 Years. Local, Experienced, Established.</p>

        <p class="hero-description" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/ann-arbor-assault-crimes.astro:kyt8at">Named a Top Ten Criminal Defense Attorney in Michigan by Leading Lawyers Magazine, Joe Simon Successfully Defending Ann Arbor Assault Cases for Over 38 Years.</p>

